@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed — Reviewed send and delivery observations
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Owner
participant "Communication owner" as C
database "Intent / attempt" as D
participant Adapter
participant Provider
Owner -> C : confirm exact account, recipients, content, attachments
C -> D : guard current eligibility; bind immutable reviewed intent
C -> Adapter : dispatch same attributable attempt
Adapter -> Provider : actual supported send
alt attributable acceptance
 Provider --> Adapter : provider evidence
 Adapter -> D : record accepted under current claim
else rejection with actual no-effect evidence
 Adapter -> D : record confirmed rejected
else observation absent / partial
 Adapter -> D : retain unknown / partial; no blind resend
end
C --> Owner : truthful permitted outcome
note over D,Provider
 Delivery/read are separate observations only if actually supported.
 Acceptance does not set application progress or actual submission.
end note

@enduml
